{"inkVersion":21,"root":[[["done",{"#f":5,"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"start":[["^Hey.","\n","^Didn't think anyone would be out here this late.","\n","^You work this place?","\n","^Listen… I don’t wanna make trouble.","\n","^I just need a minute inside.","\n","ev","str","^Who are you?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^It's late. What do you want?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"who_are_you"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"what_do_you_want"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"who_are_you":[["^My name's Shane.","\n","^Deloitte family. We live a ways down the road.","\n","^I’m not here to steal anything or mess around.","\n","^There’s something in there that belongs to my family.","\n","^Something that never got handled right.","\n","ev","str","^Handled how?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Rules are rules. I can’t let you in.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"handled_how"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"refused_early"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"what_do_you_want":[["^I just need to see a grave.","\n","^It's unmarked.","\n","^Most folks don’t even know it’s there.","\n","^I wouldn’t be here if I had another option.","\n","ev","str","^Why is it unmarked?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^That doesn’t matter. You need to leave.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"why_unmarked"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"refused_early"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"handled_how":[["^They buried them in a hurry.","\n","^Didn’t ask questions. Didn’t put a name down.","\n","^Just wanted it done and forgotten.","\n","^That kind of thing sticks with a family.","\n","^Sticks with a place too.","\n","ev","str","^You’re talking in circles. Be straight with me.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^I’m sorry, but I still can’t let you in.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"be_straight"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"refused_early"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"why_unmarked":[["^Because it was easier that way.","\n","^No paperwork or attention.","\n","^Just dirt over a problem.","\n","^I know how this sounds.","\n","^But I need to see it with my own eyes.","\n","^Make sure nothing’s… wrong.","\n","ev","str","^What could be wrong?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^No. You’re not going inside.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"whats_wrong"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"refused_early"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"be_straight":["^…Alright.","\n","^Something’s been off lately.","\n","^I haven't been able to sleep right. The guilt from the quick burial...","\n","^I just wanna make sure the plot is alright.","\n",{"->":"ask"},{"#f":1}],"whats_wrong":["^The paperwork doesn’t line up.","\n","^Dates, plot number... even the depth’s different depending on who you ask.","\n","^That usually means someone rushed it, or skipped steps they shouldn’t have.","\n","^If something was done wrong, it’s easier to fix it now than after it becomes a bigger problem.","\n","^I’ve learned that the hard way.","\n",{"->":"ask"},{"#f":1}],"ask":[["^Will you let me come in and have a look?","\n","ev","str","^Fine. You can go in, but be quick.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^No.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},"ev","str","^I have a few more questions.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":4},"ev","str","^Hold on, I'll be right back.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-3","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"let_in"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"final_refusal"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n",{"->":"more_questions"},{"#f":5}],"c-3":["\n","ev",{"x()":"SuspendDialogue"},"pop","/ev","\n",{"->":"ask"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"more_questions":[["ev","str","^What was your name again?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Who are you visiting?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},"ev","str","^How many people are in your family?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":4},"ev","str","^Nevermind.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-3","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"ask_